| Nine equal horizontal stripes of yellow (top) and red. Towards the hoist there is an [[Coat of arms of Aragon|Aragon coat of arms]]. It has a gold crown having four small green diamonds and three small red disks; its shield has four quarters, the first quarter is a gold field with a red cross on a tree, the second quarter is a blue field with a white Cross of [[Íñigo Arista]] in the top hoist-side corner, the third quarter is a red St. George Cross flag with a [[Moor's head]] in each quarter, in the fourth quarter are nine equal vertical bands of yellow and red.
